# Dart Naming Conventions

## Files
Use `snake_case`: `user_controller.dart`, `flight_booking_view.dart`

## Classes
Use `PascalCase`: `UserController`, `FlightBookingView`

## Variables & Methods
Use `camelCase`: `userName`, `fetchUserData()`

## Constants
Use `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` for global constants

## Private Members
Use `_` prefix: `_handleUserTap()`, `_isLoading`

## Riverpod Naming

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| State class | `{Name}State` | `UserState` |
| Controller | `{Name}Controller` | `UserController` |
| Provider | `{name}Provider` | `userProvider` |
| Repository | `{name}RepositoryProvider` | `userRepositoryProvider` |
